## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ForeverProbeChar

# Directives must stay contiguous. A blank line between two ## lines ends the
# header on this client and everything after it is ignored - one port diary lost
# its whole SavedVariables declaration to exactly that. Comments are fine here,
# below the header, where the file list starts.
#
# SavedVars.lua loads FIRST on purpose: it measures whether saved variables are
# restored before or after addon Lua runs, and the earliest observable moment is
# the measurement.
SavedVars.lua
DocsVersion.lua
ForeverProbe.lua
ExternalData.lua
